// The English catalogue. Keys are the Spanish source strings — see i18n.go for why.
//
// PORTED FROM ../loqui/src/shared/i18n/en.ts, AND DELIBERATELY NOT COPIED WHOLESALE. The keys are
// the Spanish copy itself, and this port changed some of it — the key placeholder says "se guarda en
// tu equipo, sin cifrar" where the original said "se cifra al guardar", because here the keys really
// are not encrypted. Copying the table would have left every reworded string silently Spanish, which
// is precisely the failure coverage_test.go exists to make impossible. It found them: the entries
// below that have no counterpart upstream were written for this port.
//
// A string that reads identically in English gets NO entry here and is declared in sameInEnglish
// instead, so the coverage test can tell "intentionally the same" from "someone forgot".
